  "title": "packet-cql.c: 2nd part of supporting CQLv5 support",
  "description": "This protocol is a bit tricky - it starts with previous versions' negotiation, then moves to the new envelope format,\nonly to have the older frame format within...\nTo support it, we keep the protocol version and where the negotiation completed in the conversation.\n\nThese 2 commits (one is merged already) now dissect both the compressed and uncompressed frames.\n\nFixes: https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/issues/20646\nSigned-off-by: Yaniv Kaul <mykaul@gmail.com>",
